# S-35 — Templates, retention, integrity and remaining events (#120–#122). Result 30 Sep 2026 (local, Development): all as expected.
# #120 list → every seeded template with `variables` (the {{ name }} placeholders of subject + body); viewer 200
# #121 update: body "{{ reference" (unclosed) → 422 template.render_failed with line/column; "{{ if x }}" without end → 422;
#   "{{ 1 | nosuchfn }}" (fails only at render) → 422 (trial render with sample values); valid body → 200 + audit `template.update`;
#   viewer → 403 auth.forbidden; unknown key → 404
# #122 test send: SMS to 0551110021 → 202 {rendered} and the SMS in /dev/sms; e-mail to ops@example.test → 202 and the .eml in
#   /dev/mail; unset variables show as [name]; bad recipient → 400 validation.failed; unknown template → 404
# jobs (/dev/jobs lists 11 + OutboxDispatcher):
