#     e-mailed "check 3 — Stock counters match the ledger: 1 row(s)" (counter restored afterwards)
#   Retention: a notification, a processed outbox row (its notification FK nulled first) and a download_log row back-dated past the
#     window → deleted; payment_event.payload scrubbed; inactive beneficiary B-000006 back-dated 2 years → name/mobile/notes erased,
#     code and region kept
#   PruneIdempotencyKeys: a key back-dated 25 h → deleted (43 → 42)
# rebuild: publish / archive smoke-book → CatalogChanged outbox rows processed; "Site rebuild not configured (Store:SiteRebuild);
#   skipped" logged (no repository/token in Development); one pending message at a time (debounce at enqueue)
# integrity checks (db/reference/003) → 0 rows
@base = http://localhost:5080/v1
@admin = <admin access token>

### #120 Templates (staff:read)
GET {{base}}/admin/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### #121 Update (staff:admin) — Scriban validated on save
PUT {{base}}/admin/templates/order_paid/sms/ar
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":"تم استلام طلبك {{ reference }} بمبلغ {{ total }} ر.س. الإيصال: {{ link }}"}

